he community of urban artists!\nJoin us from September 10th to 22th at Place de la Bourse and other towns in Belgium!","longdescr":"The festival is bubbling all summer long with the Detours Cyphers: the very essence of the festival!\nThe Cyphers take place every Wednesday in the center of Brussels and in various towns in the FWB (Namur, Li\u00e8ge, Mons, Verviers) and abroad (Lille - France, Goma - DRC, Casablanca - Morocco).\n\nIt's take place in 3 parts: \nAn open stage open to all\nA street performance: a dance, circus and street art creation designed for the street.\nA dance battle in a different style each week\n\nThe final of these battles brings together the winners of each week on the large stage of the Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National for a colorful closing evening of the festival on September 14!\n\nTranslated with DeepL.com (free version)","performers":"\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.detoursfestival.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009920"},"it":{"name":"Detours festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.detoursfestival.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009920"},"cn":{"name":"Detours festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.detoursfestival.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009920"},"fr":{"name":"Detours festival","shortdescr":"Le Detours Festival f\u00eate ses 15 ans cette ann\u00e9e ! Sa programmation interdisciplinaire se d\u00e9cline entre battles, cr\u00e9ations en danse urbaine, musique et performances. Des \u00e9v\u00e9nements qui sont devenus incontournables pour le grand public et la communaut\u00e9 des artistes urbain.es!\nRetrouvez-nous du 10 au 22 septembre sur la place de la Bourse et d'autres villes de la F\u00e9d\u00e9ration Wallonie-Bruxelles!","longdescr":"Le festival bouillonne tout l\u2019\u00e9t\u00e9 avec les Detours Cyphers :  l\u2019essence m\u00eame du festival !\nLes Cyphers ont lieu chaque mercredi au centre de Bruxelles et dans diff\u00e9rentes villes de la FWB (Namur, Li\u00e8ge, Mons, Verviers) et \u00e0 l\u2019international (Lille \u2013 France, Goma \u2013 RDC, Casablanca \u2013 Maroc).\n\nIls se d\u00e9roulent en 3 parties : \nUne sc\u00e8ne ouverte accessible \u00e0 tous.tes\nUn spectacle en rue : une cr\u00e9ation con\u00e7ue pour la rue, en danse, cirque et art de rue\nUn battle de danse dans un style diff\u00e9rent chaque semaine\n\nLa finale de ces battles rassemble les gagnant.e.s de chaque semaine sur le grand plateau du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National pour une soir\u00e9e de cl\u00f4ture du festival haut en couleurs le 14 septembre !\n","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.detoursfestival.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009920"},"sp":{"name":"Detours festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.detoursfestival.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009920"},"nl":{"name":"Detours festival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.detoursfestival.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009920"}},"place":{"id":238722,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Place de la Bourse","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":n