"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"},"en":{"name":"Alan Tex retrospective exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/atelier34zero.be\/","email":"info@atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"},"it":{"name":"Alan Tex retrospective exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/atelier34zero.be\/","email":"info@atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"},"cn":{"name":"Alan Tex retrospective exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/atelier34zero.be\/","email":"info@atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"},"fr":{"name":"Exposition R\u00e9trospective d'Alan Tex","shortdescr":"Plongez dans l'univers unique de l'artiste bruxellois, Alan Tex, o\u00f9 l'inspiration circassienne et th\u00e9\u00e2trale se m\u00ealent \u00e0 des r\u00e9f\u00e9rences \u00e0 la peinture ancienne et aux arts extra-europ\u00e9ens. Alan Tex r\u00e9volutionne l'art de la photographie en mettant en lumi\u00e8re des corps non conventionnels \u00e0 travers des compositions th\u00e9\u00e2trales et des d\u00e9cors somptueusement \u00e9labor\u00e9s. ","longdescr":"Venez d\u00e9couvrir une exposition exceptionnelle consacr\u00e9e \u00e0 Alan Tex, un artiste dont les contributions significatives dans le domaine de la photographie valorisent les corps nus par le biais de mises en sc\u00e8ne th\u00e9\u00e2trales. L'exposition se tiendra du 6 juillet au 29 septembre 2024 \u00e0 l\u2019Atelier 34zero Muzeum.\n\nDans l'univers visuel d'Alan Tex, chaque image d\u00e9ploie une narration clownesque, saisissant l'essence de l'humanit\u00e9 et de son environnement. Ses \u0153uvres transportent les spectateurs dans une exploration introspective, d\u00e9voilant avec force les multiples dimensions de la condition humaine. Elles abordent des th\u00e8mes universels tels que le plaisir, les \u00e9motions, l'enfance et la mort, avec une profondeur et une sensibilit\u00e9 remarquables. Cette exposition pr\u00e9sentera une collection unique de ses \u0153uvres, offrant ainsi une vue d'ensemble de son \u00e9volution artistique.\n\nL\u2019exposition r\u00e9trospective d\u00e9voilera une large s\u00e9lection de son travail photographique, o\u00f9 l'inspiration circassienne et th\u00e9\u00e2trale se m\u00eale \u00e0 des r\u00e9f\u00e9rences \u00e0 la peinture ancienne et aux arts extra-europ\u00e9ens. Les compositions th\u00e9\u00e2trales d\u2019Alan Tex mettent en avant une mise en sc\u00e8ne \u00e9labor\u00e9e et des d\u00e9cors minutieusement con\u00e7us avec une perspective unique.","performers":"Alan Tex (photogaphe)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/atelier34zero.be\/","email":"info@atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"},"sp":{"name":"Alan Tex retrospective exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/atelier34zero.be\/","email":"info@atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"},"nl":{"name":"Alan Tex retrospectieve tentoonstelling","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/atelier34zero.be\/","email":"info@atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012658"}},"place":{"id":554,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Die Geb\u00e4ude und der Park bergen einen Ausstellungraum, ein Dokumentationszentrum, eine Fachbuchhandlung, einen Ausstellungsgarten und ein Caf\u00e9. Die Sammlung umfasst Werke von Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers und Christine Wilm\u00e8s. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum is an independent art centre, created in 2014. Born from the ashes of the Atelier 340 Muzeum, its main mission is the study and promotion of sculpture and three-dimensional art in Belgium and abroad.\r\nAtelier 34zero Muzeum organises 3 to 4 exhibitions a year in its own spaces as well as several events extra muros. Three types of exhibitions are organised: thematic, confrontational or comparative, and personal (retrospectives). These are accompanied by quality publications; quadrilingual and richly illustrated catalogues, and postcards. \r\nAlong with its exhibitions, Atelier 34zero Muzeum is building up a collection of artworks as a memory of past activities and a tool for further questioning. It contains work of Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers and  Christine Wilm\u00e8s, among others.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Les b\u00e2timents et le parc accueillent les salles d\u2019exposition, un centre de documentation, une librairie sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e, des projections de films, un jardin d\u2019exposition et un caf\u00e9. La collection abrite des \u0153uvres d\u2019Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers et Christine Wilm\u00e8s. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"de Rivierendreef","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"de Rivierendreef, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Het Atelier 34zero Muzeum is een onafhankelijk kunstencentrum dat in 2014 opgericht is. Het herrees uit de as van het Atelier 340 Muzeum. Zijn belangrijkste roeping is de studie en promotie van de beeldhouwkunst en de driedimensionale kunst, zowel in Belgi\u00eb als in het buitenland.\r\nAtelier 34zero Muzeum organiseert 3 tot 4 tentoonstellingen per jaar in eigen ruimtes evenals evenementen extra muros. Drie types tentoonstellingen worden gerealiseerd: thematische, vergelijkende of confronterende, en persoonlijke (retrospectieven). Deze gaan gepaard met de uitgave van kwaliteitsvolle, viertalige, rijk ge\u00efllustreerde catalogen evenals postkaarten. Parallel met de tentoonstellingen bouwt Atelier 34zero Muzeum een kunstcollectie op als geheugen van voorbije activiteiten en als handleiding bij verder onderzoek. Zo bevat de collectie o.a. werk van Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers et Christine Wilm\u00e8s. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[20],"translations":{"de":["Norden"],"pt":[null],"en":["North"],"it":["Nord"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Nord"],"sp":["Norte"],"nl":["Noord"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":126,"location":{"lat":50.88011078,"lon":4.32243991},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-13T13:11:22+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:18+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":554,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Die Geb\u00e4ude und der Park bergen einen Ausstellungraum, ein Dokumentationszentrum, eine Fachbuchhandlung, einen Ausstellungsgarten und ein Caf\u00e9. Die Sammlung umfasst Werke von Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers und Christine Wilm\u00e8s. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum is an independent art centre, created in 2014. Born from the ashes of the Atelier 340 Muzeum, its main mission is the study and promotion of sculpture and three-dimensional art in Belgium and abroad.\r\nAtelier 34zero Muzeum organises 3 to 4 exhibitions a year in its own spaces as well as several events extra muros. Three types of exhibitions are organised: thematic, confrontational or comparative, and personal (retrospectives). These are accompanied by quality publications; quadrilingual and richly illustrated catalogues, and postcards. \r\nAlong with its exhibitions, Atelier 34zero Muzeum is building up a collection of artworks as a memory of past activities and a tool for further questioning. It contains work of Ado Hamelrijck, Wladyslaw Hasior, Pal Horvath, Jem, Roman Karalus, Walter Leblanc, Jean-Philippe Lecharlier, Waclaw Szpakowski, Guy Stukens, Bernar Venet, Bob Verschueren, Bernard Villers and  Christine Wilm\u00e8s, among others.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"ATELIER 34ZERO MUZEUM","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","website":"http:\/\/www.atelier34zero.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 428 33 06","phone_booking":"+32 2 428 33 06","address_zip":"1090","address_city":"Jette","address_line1":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren, 334","address_line2":"1090 Jette","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Atelier 34zero Muzeum","address_street_name":"Dr\u00e8ve de Rivieren","address_street_number":"334","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@atelier34zero.be","