"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"expo","ranking":0.2770984186529621,"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[39,36],"translations":{"de":["Fotografie","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Photography","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Fotografia","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Photographie","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Fotograf\u00eda","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Fotografie","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"pt":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"en":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"it":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"cn":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"fr":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":"Solal Israel a une approche plasticienne de la photographie. Son exposition personnelle Soon this space will be too small ne pr\u00e9sente pas des s\u00e9ries th\u00e9matiques, mais des clich\u00e9s uniques produits d\u2019une exp\u00e9rimentation de la mati\u00e8re photographique \u00e0 travers diff\u00e9rents proc\u00e9d\u00e9s d\u2019alt\u00e9ration. ","longdescr":"Des images qui, alt\u00e9r\u00e9es, oscillent entre le lisible et l\u2019illisible. Pourtant, des traces de pr\u00e9sence humaine et des fragments de paysage, des textures et des sensations se r\u00e9v\u00e8lent \u00e0 nous. Des indices sem\u00e9s par Solal Israel pour nous laisser entrevoir ce qui est, ce qui n\u2019est pas, ce qui aurait pu \u00eatre\u2026 ouvrant ainsi la voie \u00e0 une lecture personnelle de l\u2019image.\n\n* * *\n\nN\u00e9 \u00e0 Bruxelles en 1993, Solal Israel grandit dans un milieu artistique et se lance dans la photographie \u00e0 17 ans, discipline qu\u2019il \u00e9tudie \u00e0 l\u2019\u00c9SA Le 75 de 2011 \u00e0 2014. Parmi ses r\u00e9alisations, il y a le livre [Never] Let me go, un recueil dans lequel il pr\u00e9sente son travail entre 2012 et 2016, ou encore l\u2019exposition Regarde mon histoire\/Kijk naar mijn verhaal au Hangar en 2021. Son parcours l\u2019am\u00e8ne \u00e0 faire un tour du monde de d\u00e9but 2017 \u00e0 mi-2018. Solal Israel est \u00e9galement cofondateur de la La Nombreuse asbl, collectif de photographes et espace de cr\u00e9ation \u00e0 Saint-Gilles.\n\n* * *\n\nVendredi 31 mai, 18h - vernissage ouvert \u00e0 toustes.\n\nSamedi 8 juin, 16h - visite guid\u00e9e avec l'artiste.\n\nMercredi 12 juin, 19h15 - soir\u00e9e EXPO+DOC, visite guid\u00e9e suivie d'une projection. En collaboration avec le Centre du Film sur l'Art. ","performers":"Solal Israel","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"sp":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"},"nl":{"name":"Soon this space will be too small  |  Solal Israel | Photographie","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/lejacquesfranck.be\/event\/soon-this-space-will-be-too-small\/2024-05-31\/","email":"info@lejacquesfranck.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 538 90 20","phone_booking":"+32 2 538 90 20","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50009266"}},"place":{"id":4,"tr