mail":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"pt":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"en":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"it":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"cn":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"fr":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":"Parodie pour marionnettes, en bruxellois fran\u00e7ais.","longdescr":"Comment Toone en est-il arriv\u00e9 \u00e0 Gounod ? Au temps o\u00f9 La Monnaie, maintenant Op\u00e9ra National, disposait de privil\u00e8ges \u00e9crasants par rapport aux autres th\u00e9\u00e2tres de Bruxelles, T\u00f4\u00f4ne-Dufeys (une autre dynastie de marionnettistes) se rendait r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement \u00e0 l\u2019Op\u00e9ra pour y copier le plus fid\u00e8lement possible ces grands spectacles inaccessibles pour le peuple des Marolles et les pr\u00e9senter ensuite dans son th\u00e9\u00e2tre.\n\nLes marionnettes traditionnelles \u00e9taient alors le seul moyen d\u2019\u00e9ducation populaire d\u2019un public toujours pr\u00eat \u00e0 s\u2019enthousiasmer pour les plus grandes oeuvres. Toone VII \u00e0 son tour se pencha sur l\u2019op\u00e9ra de Gounod pour en faire une adaptation parodique.\n\n\u00ab ... Tandis que le docteur Faust boit une derni\u00e8re gueuze dans l\u2019espoir d\u2019une mort subite, un inqui\u00e9tant personnage, le \u201cDeuvel\u201d, vient lui proposer des paquets de billets de mille et une belle \u201cmokske\u201d au doux nom de Marguerite, en \u00e9change de son \u00e2me. On fait un tour \u00e0 la foire du midi, on passe (en coulisses) une nuit enchanteresse et... c\u2019est le coup de foudre. Avec une cons\u00e9quence pour Marguerite : \u201cDes robes qui vont devenir trop courtes par devant\u201d...\n\nQuiconque s\u2019aventure dans le vaste univers que repr\u00e9sente ce sujet comprendra, \u00e0 travers l\u2019humour, le sentiment de paix int\u00e9rieure qui l\u2019anime. On devine ais\u00e9ment ce que peuvent donner des m\u00e9lodies telles que Salut, demeure chaste et pure ou Anges purs, anges radieux accommod\u00e9es \u00e0 la sauce bruxelloise... \u00bb (La Lanterne)\n\nFid\u00e8le \u00e0 la tradition, Toone fait toutes les voix et n\u2019h\u00e9site pas \u00e0 pousser le grand air des bijoux \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9gal de notre c\u00e9l\u00e8bre Castafiore.\n\nLes d\u00e9cors et costumes de Raymond Renard donnent \u00e0 Marguerite toutes les raisons de se voir si belle en ce miroir.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"sp":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"},"nl":{"name":"Faust","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.toone.be","email":"woltje@skynet.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013069"}},"place":{"id":231143,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Marionettentheater - Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"W\u00e4hrend der spanischen Besetzung der Niederlande wurden zwangsweise s\u00e4mtliche Theater geschlossen, um Kritik - in Form von satirischen St\u00fccken - an den spanischen Herrschern zu unterbinden. Die Br\u00fcsseler haben alsdann die Schauspieler durch Marionetten (\"Poechenelles\" in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart) ersetzt, die in illegalen Theatern auftragen. \r\nAnfang des 19. Jahrhunderts z\u00e4hlten die Br\u00fcsseler Marionettentheater zu den beliebtesten Vergn\u00fcgungen f\u00fcr Erwachsene, denn sie boten eine enorme Freiheit, ben\u00f6tigen nur wenig finanzielle Mittel und konnten \u00fcberall aufgef\u00fchrt werden. Ihr Repertoire ist bis heute sehr vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von volkst\u00fcmlichen Legenden \u00fcber Rittergeschichten bis hin zu religi\u00f6sen oder historischen St\u00fccken, die sehr frei interpretiert werden. \r\nSeit der Gr\u00fcndung des Theaters im Marollenviertel ist nun bereits die 9. Puppenspielergeneration der Toone-Dynastie am Werk. Der jeweils neue Toone (Br\u00fcsseler Kosename f\u00fcr \"Antoine\", so der Vorname des Gr\u00fcnders) muss sowohl von seinem Vorg\u00e4nger als auch von dem Publikum angenommen werden - und so ist es nicht unbedingt der jeweilige Sohn, der die Nachfolge antritt. \r\nDie Klassiker werden in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart und manchmal auch auf Niederl\u00e4ndisch oder Franz\u00f6sisch aufgef\u00fchrt. \r\nDas Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone birgt auch ein urige Schenke und ein Marionettenmuseum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"During the Spanish occupation of the Netherlands all theaters were closed to prevent the actors from raising satirical pieces against the Spanish rulers. As a result, doll shows came into play: it was easier to tolerate the fierce dialogues when pronounced by lifeless dolls. About 1830 Antoine \"Toone\" Genty opened  a puppet theater, then in the Marolles. More than 180 years later, this popular entertainment has grown into a Royal Puppet Theater. After Genty, his (unrelated) successors would also be called Toone (Antoine).\r\nThe classics are performed in the local Brussels dialect with wooden puppets (the so-called poechenel), sometimes in Dutch or in French. The puppet theater and museum has been located near the Grand Place for four decades. The theater is located on the upper floors of the building, on the ground floor there is a pub. The museum contains old dolls, including 19th century specimens.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Teatro di Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Traditional Brussels\u2019 puppet theater & museum - Typical caf\u00e9\r\nBordering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Traditioneel marionettentheater Brusselse folklore - Typisch Staminee.\r\nMuseum van Toone: Gratis toegang voor het publiek tijdens de pauze.\r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone in Brussel is een origineel en authentiek poppentheater dat doorspekt is van Brusselse geschiedenis en cultuur! \r\nHet Koninklijk Theater Toone zet sinds 1830 de eeuwenoude traditie van het volkse Theater voort.\r\nDe programmatie is gebaseerd op grote toneelklassiekers zoals \"Cyrano de Bergerac\" van Edmond Rostand, \"De Drie Musketiers\" van Alexandre Dumas, \"Romeo en Julia\" van William Shakespeare en \"Tijl Uilenspiegel\" van Charles De Coster. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[13],"translations":{"de":["Historisches Stadtzentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Historical Centre"],"it":["Centro storico"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre historique"],"sp":["Centro hist\u00f3rico"],"nl":["Historisch centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":913,"location":{"lat":50.8471135,"lon":4.3536487},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-10-24T15:31:21+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:54+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":231143,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Marionettentheater - Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"W\u00e4hrend der spanischen Besetzung der Niederlande wurden zwangsweise s\u00e4mtliche Theater geschlossen, um Kritik - in Form von satirischen St\u00fccken - an den spanischen Herrschern zu unterbinden. Die Br\u00fcsseler haben alsdann die Schauspieler durch Marionetten (\"Poechenelles\" in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart) ersetzt, die in illegalen Theatern auftragen. \r\nAnfang des 19. Jahrhunderts z\u00e4hlten die Br\u00fcsseler Marionettentheater zu den beliebtesten Vergn\u00fcgungen f\u00fcr Erwachsene, denn sie boten eine enorme Freiheit, ben\u00f6tigen nur wenig finanzielle Mittel und konnten \u00fcberall aufgef\u00fchrt werden. Ihr Repertoire ist bis heute sehr vielf\u00e4ltig und reicht von volkst\u00fcmlichen Legenden \u00fcber Rittergeschichten bis hin zu religi\u00f6sen oder historischen St\u00fccken, die sehr frei interpretiert werden. \r\nSeit der Gr\u00fcndung des Theaters im Marollenviertel ist nun bereits die 9. Puppenspielergeneration der Toone-Dynastie am Werk. Der jeweils neue Toone (Br\u00fcsseler Kosename f\u00fcr \"Antoine\", so der Vorname des Gr\u00fcnders) muss sowohl von seinem Vorg\u00e4nger als auch von dem Publikum angenommen werden - und so ist es nicht unbedingt der jeweilige Sohn, der die Nachfolge antritt. \r\nDie Klassiker werden in Br\u00fcsseler Mundart und manchmal auch auf Niederl\u00e4ndisch oder Franz\u00f6sisch aufgef\u00fchrt. \r\nDas Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone birgt auch ein urige Schenke und ein Marionettenmuseum.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"During the Spanish occupation of the Netherlands all theaters were closed to prevent the actors from raising satirical pieces against the Spanish rulers. As a result, doll shows came into play: it was easier to tolerate the fierce dialogues when pronounced by lifeless dolls. About 1830 Antoine \"Toone\" Genty opened  a puppet theater, then in the Marolles. More than 180 years later, this popular entertainment has grown into a Royal Puppet Theater. After Genty, his (unrelated) successors would also be called Toone (Antoine).\r\nThe classics are performed in the local Brussels dialect with wooden puppets (the so-called poechenel), sometimes in Dutch or in French. The puppet theater and museum has been located near the Grand Place for four decades. The theater is located on the upper floors of the building, on the ground floor there is a pub. The museum contains old dolls, including 19th century specimens.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Teatro di Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Traditional Brussels\u2019 puppet theater & museum - Typical caf\u00e9\r\nBordering the Impasses Schuddeveld and Sainte-P\u00e9tronille, you will find one of the favourite places of Brussels citizens: Le th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone.\r\nTheater Toone is simultaneously a typical estaminet with its Spanish pink brick walls, blackened beams and tiled floor, a puppet theatre in the attic, with its wooden benches, festooned, multicoloured cushions nailed into the raw wood planks and a puppet museum. There, we find the characters who retired from the stage, these Toone heroes of the past and fetish characters of fellow puppeteers from around the world.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de Toone","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone: un th\u00e9\u00e2tre original et authentique, impr\u00e9gn\u00e9 d\u2019histoire et de culture bruxelloise !\r\nId\u00e9alement situ\u00e9 \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 de la Grand-Place, dans une maison v\u00e9n\u00e9rable datant de 1696, le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal de Toone poursuit la tradition s\u00e9culaire du th\u00e9\u00e2tre populaire de marionnettes depuis 1830. \r\nLa programmation est bas\u00e9e sur les grands classiques du th\u00e9\u00e2tre tels que \u00ab Les Trois Mousquetaires \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s Alexandre Dumas ou encore \u00ab Rom\u00e9o et Juliette \u00bb d\u2019apr\u00e8s William Shakespeare.\r\nActuellement, le mus\u00e9e permanent de Toone situ\u00e9 au premier \u00e9tage du b\u00e2timent principal se visite gratuitement pendant l\u2019entracte.\r\nL\u2019estaminet folklorique au rez-de-chauss\u00e9e est ouvert tous les jours de 12h00 \u00e0 24h00, sauf le lundi (jour de fermeture).\r\nC\u2019est  un estaminet tricentenaire o\u00f9, dans une ambiance authentique de briques roses espagnoles, poutres noircies et sol dall\u00e9, vous pourrez appr\u00e9cier quelques bi\u00e8res, dont la c\u00e9l\u00e8bre gueuze. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Teatro Toone VII","address_street_name":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue du March\u00e9 aux Herbes - Entr\u00e9e : Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Poppentheater Toone","address_street_name":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille","address_street_number":"66","address_street_box":null,"email":"woltje@skynet.be","website":"http:\/\/www.toone.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 511 71 37","phone_booking":"+32 2 513 54 86","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Grasmarkt - Ingang: Impasse Sainte P\u00e9tronille, 66","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Tradition