"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"pt":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"en":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":"28 large-format photographs taken in the Mandela Park township in Cape Town by Nadine Deruyck. Full details of the exhibition are available at www.nadinederuyck.be","longdescr":"Since the early 90s, Jean-Luc Van Damme has been visiting South Africa as a filmproducer. During one of his trips with Nadine Deruyck, they conceived the idea of developing a photographic project in a Cape Town township. In early 2024, they decided to bring this vision to life in Imizamo Yethu township, also known as Mandela Park, situated in Hout Bay, south of Cape Town.\nImizamo Yethu (Xhosa, meaning \"Our Efforts\" and commonly known as Mandela Park) faces significant challenges including poverty, crime and unemployment rates exceeding 40%. Despite these hardships, the township is uniquely situated within a residential area that provides substantial employment opportunities for its residents. The township hosts two free schools \u2014 a primary and a secondary school \u2014 where uniforms are mandatory. \nThis initiative highlights the daily lives of the residents of Imizamo Yethu.\nThe exhibition features two types of portraits: one capturing inhabitants in their natural environments, and another in a formal headshot style against a black backdrop.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"it":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"cn":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"fr":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":"28 photos grand format r\u00e9alis\u00e9e dans le township Mandela Park de Cape Town par Nadine Deruyck. Tous les d\u00e9tails de l'exposition sont sur www.nadinederuyck.be","longdescr":"Depuis le d\u00e9but des ann\u00e9es 90, Jean-Luc Van Damme visite l'Afrique du Sud en tant que producteur de films. Lors d'un de ses voyages avec Nadine Deruyck, ils ont eu l'id\u00e9e de d\u00e9velopper un projet photographique dans un township de Cape Town. D\u00e9but 2024, ils ont d\u00e9cid\u00e9 de concr\u00e9tiser cette vision dans le township d'Imizamo Yethu, \u00e9galement connu sous le nom de Mandela Park, situ\u00e9 \u00e0 Hout Bay, au sud de Cape Town.\nImizamo Yethu fait face \u00e0 des d\u00e9fis significatifs, notamment la pauvret\u00e9, la criminalit\u00e9 et un taux de ch\u00f4mage d\u00e9passant 40 %. Malgr\u00e9 ces difficult\u00e9s, le township est strat\u00e9giquement situ\u00e9 au sein d'une zone r\u00e9sidentielle offrant de nombreuses opportunit\u00e9s d'emploi \u00e0 ses habitants. Le township abrite deux \u00e9coles gratuites \u2014 une \u00e9cole primaire et une \u00e9cole secondaire \u2014 o\u00f9 le port de l'uniforme est obligatoire.\nCe travail photographique d\u00e9peint la vie quotidienne des r\u00e9sidents d'Imizamo Yethu, dans le but de mettre en lumi\u00e8re leurs exp\u00e9riences et leurs r\u00e9alit\u00e9s. Ce projet ne se contente pas de documenter la vie des habitants du township, il sert \u00e9galement de plateforme pour mettre en avant leurs histoires et leurs d\u00e9fis \u00e0 travers l'art de la photographie.\nL'exposition pr\u00e9sente deux types de portraits : l'un capturant les habitants dans leur environnement naturel, et l'autre dans un style de portrait formel en t\u00eate-\u00e0-t\u00eate sur fond noir.","performers":"Nadine Deruyck\nJean-Luc Van Damme","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"sp":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"},"nl":{"name":"Cape Town Ship","shortdescr":"28 portretten nemen u even mee naar de township Imizamo Yethu in Kaapstad. Alle info op: www.nadinederuyck.be","longdescr":"Sinds de vroege jaren 90 bezoekt Jean-Luc Van Damme Zuid-Afrika als filmproducer. Tijdens een van zijn reizen met Nadine Deruyck ontstond het idee om een fotografisch project te ontwikkelen in een township bij Kaapstad. Begin 2024 besloten ze om deze visie tot leven te brengen in Imizamo Yethu township, ook bekend als Mandela Park, gelegen in Hout Bay ten zuiden van Kaapstad.\nImizamo Yethu staat voor aanzienlijke uitdagingen, waaronder armoede, criminaliteit en een werkloosheidspercentage van meer dan 40%. Ondanks deze moeilijkheden ligt de township op een unieke locatie binnen een woongebied dat aanzienlijke werkgelegenheidskansen biedt voor haar inwoners. De township herbergt twee gratis scholen \u2014 een basisschool en een middelbare school \u2014 waar schooluniformen verplicht zijn. \nDit initiatief belicht het dagelijks leven van de inwoners van Imizamo Yethu.\nDe tentoonstelling omvat twee soorten portretten: \u00e9\u00e9n waarbij inwoners worden vastgelegd in hun natuurlijke omgeving, en een ander in een formele headshot-stijl tegen een zwarte achtergrond.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.nadinederuyck.be","email":"jeanlucvd@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 475 23 23 80","phone_booking":"+32 475 23 23 80","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.5700000076"}},"place":{"id":266533,"translations":{"de":{"name":"DROH!ME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Der DROHME Park auf dem ehemaligen, 32 Hektar gro\u00dfen Gel\u00e4nde der Pferderennbahn am Rande des Br\u00fcsseler Stadtwaldes For\u00eat de Soignes, pr\u00e4sentiert sich als Vorl\u00e4ufer einen neuen Freizeitpark-Generation. Das innovative Konzept, bei dem die Natur im Mittelpunkt steht, bietet eine ganze Reihe generationen\u00fcbergreifender Aktivit\u00e4ten rund um 5 Themen: Natur, Sport, Kultur, Bildung und Entspannung. DROHME f\u00fcgt sich nahtlos in die ausgegebene Devise \u201eBr\u00fcssel, nachhaltige Stadt\u201c ein und wird in diesem Zusammenhang eine wichtige Rolle spielen.\r\n\r\nDas Gel\u00e4nde der Pferderennbahn, das einst die Br\u00fcsseler Hochburg des mond\u00e4nen Pferderennsports, Ort der Begegnung und der Kurzweil war, fiel ab 1995 in eine Art Dornr\u00f6schenschlaf. Und mit dem \u00e4u\u00dferlichen Verfall verlor der Ort auch sein Prestige, seine Anziehungskraft und seine urspr\u00fcngliche Funktion.\r\n\r\nDas Projekt DROHME Park hat es sich zum Ziel gesetzt, dem Ort seine urspr\u00fcngliche Attraktivit\u00e4t zur\u00fcckzuverleihen \u2013 als Naherholungsgebiet, Sport- und Freizeitst\u00e4tte f\u00fcr Jung und Alt im Zeichen von Natur und Kulturerbe bei gleichzeitiger Bewahrung der Identit\u00e4t des Ortes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"DROHME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"DROHME Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"DROH!ME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"DROHME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"DROHME Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Site embl\u00e9matique de 32 hectares, vert et arbor\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019or\u00e9e de la For\u00eat de Soignes, DROHME Park, initie une toute nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration de parc de loisirs actifs. Ce concept unique et pr\u00e9curseur, centr\u00e9 sur la nature propose plusieurs activit\u00e9s \u00e0 caract\u00e8re pluri-g\u00e9n\u00e9rationnel via 5 types d\u2019activit\u00e9s : nature, sport, culture, \u00e9ducation et d\u00e9tente. DROHME s\u2019ins\u00e8re tout naturellement dans l\u2019objectif de \u00ab Bruxelles, Ville durable \u00bb et en sera un acteur majeur.\r\n\r\nAutrefois lieu incontournable de la vie sportive et mondaine, lieu de rencontres, de d\u00e9tente et d\u2019activit\u00e9s \u00e9questres pour les Bruxellois, il entame en 1995 une p\u00e9riode de quasi-abandon et de d\u00e9gradation, perdant son prestige et toutes ses fonctions originelles.\r\n\r\nLe projet DROHME Park propose de lui rendre son attractivit\u00e9 d\u2019antan, sa fonction de porte d\u2019entr\u00e9e de la For\u00eat de Soignes, d\u2019espace de loisirs et de sport pour le grand public, de d\u00e9couverte de la nature et du patrimoine, tout en pr\u00e9servant son identit\u00e9 si particuli\u00e8re et insolite.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"DROH!ME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"DROHME Park","address_street_name":"Terhulpensesteenweg","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Terhulpensesteenweg, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"DROHME Park ontvouwt zich op een groen en bosrijk gebied van 32 hectare aan de rand van het Zoni\u00ebnwoud en is een nieuw soort domein voor actieve recreatie. Zijn uniek en baanbrekend natuurgebonden concept biedt verschillende activiteiten voor alle leeftijden aan met 5 verschillende thema\u2019s: natuur, sport, cultuur, educatie en ontspanning. DROHME sluit naadloos aan bij de doelstellingen van \u2018Brussel, duurzame stad\u2019 en zal er \u00e9\u00e9n van de belangrijkste spelers van zijn.\r\n\r\nDe hippodroom was lange tijd een epicentrum voor sport en ontmoetingen, een plek waar Brusselaars kwamen ontspannen of aan paardenactiviteiten deelnemen. Vanaf 1995 begon echter het verval, toen de site zo goed als verlaten werd en zo stilaan zijn prestige en al zijn oorspronkelijke functies verloor.\r\n\r\nHet project DROHME Park wil de hippodroom in zijn vroegere glorie herstellen: als toegangspoort tot het Zoni\u00ebnwoud, als sport- en ontspanningsruimte voor het grote publiek en als locatie voor ontdekking van milieu en erfgoed, zonder echter aan zijn bijzondere identiteit te raken.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":26533,"location":{"lat":50.79681453,"lon":4.39647355},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-08-07T16:20:31+02:00","published_at":"2016-10-05T09:59:55+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":266533,"translations":{"de":{"name":"DROH!ME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Der DROHME Park auf dem ehemaligen, 32 Hektar gro\u00dfen Gel\u00e4nde der Pferderennbahn am Rande des Br\u00fcsseler Stadtwaldes For\u00eat de Soignes, pr\u00e4sentiert sich als Vorl\u00e4ufer einen neuen Freizeitpark-Generation. Das innovative Konzept, bei dem die Natur im Mittelpunkt steht, bietet eine ganze Reihe generationen\u00fcbergreifender Aktivit\u00e4ten rund um 5 Themen: Natur, Sport, Kultur, Bildung und Entspannung. DROHME f\u00fcgt sich nahtlos in die ausgegebene Devise \u201eBr\u00fcssel, nachhaltige Stadt\u201c ein und wird in diesem Zusammenhang eine wichtige Rolle spielen.\r\n\r\nDas Gel\u00e4nde der Pferderennbahn, das einst die Br\u00fcsseler Hochburg des mond\u00e4nen Pferderennsports, Ort der Begegnung und der Kurzweil war, fiel ab 1995 in eine Art Dornr\u00f6schenschlaf. Und mit dem \u00e4u\u00dferlichen Verfall verlor der Ort auch sein Prestige, seine Anziehungskraft und seine urspr\u00fcngliche Funktion.\r\n\r\nDas Projekt DROHME Park hat es sich zum Ziel gesetzt, dem Ort seine urspr\u00fcngliche Attraktivit\u00e4t zur\u00fcckzuverleihen \u2013 als Naherholungsgebiet, Sport- und Freizeitst\u00e4tte f\u00fcr Jung und Alt im Zeichen von Natur und Kulturerbe bei gleichzeitiger Bewahrung der Identit\u00e4t des Ortes.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"DROHME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"DROHME Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"DROH!ME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"DROHME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"DROHME Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":"Site embl\u00e9matique de 32 hectares, vert et arbor\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019or\u00e9e de la For\u00eat de Soignes, DROHME Park, initie une toute nouvelle g\u00e9n\u00e9ration de parc de loisirs actifs. Ce concept unique et pr\u00e9curseur, centr\u00e9 sur la nature propose plusieurs activit\u00e9s \u00e0 caract\u00e8re pluri-g\u00e9n\u00e9rationnel via 5 types d\u2019activit\u00e9s : nature, sport, culture, \u00e9ducation et d\u00e9tente. DROHME s\u2019ins\u00e8re tout naturellement dans l\u2019objectif de \u00ab Bruxelles, Ville durable \u00bb et en sera un acteur majeur.\r\n\r\nAutrefois lieu incontournable de la vie sportive et mondaine, lieu de rencontres, de d\u00e9tente et d\u2019activit\u00e9s \u00e9questres pour les Bruxellois, il entame en 1995 une p\u00e9riode de quasi-abandon et de d\u00e9gradation, perdant son prestige et toutes ses fonctions originelles.\r\n\r\nLe projet DROHME Park propose de lui rendre son attractivit\u00e9 d\u2019antan, sa fonction de porte d\u2019entr\u00e9e de la For\u00eat de Soignes, d\u2019espace de loisirs et de sport pour le grand public, de d\u00e9couverte de la nature et du patrimoine, tout en pr\u00e9servant son identit\u00e9 si particuli\u00e8re et insolite.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"DROH!ME Melting Park","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Uccle","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de La Hulpe, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Uccle","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"DROHME Park","address_street_name":"Terhulpensesteenweg","address_street_number":"53 a 55","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@drohme.be","website":"http:\/\/www.drohme.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 613 09 09","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1180","address_city":"Ukkel","address_line1":"Terhulpensesteenweg, 53 a 55","address_line2":"1180 Ukkel","description_web":"DROHME Park ontvouwt zich op een groen en bosrijk gebied van 32 hectare aan de rand van het Zoni\u00ebnwoud en is een nieuw soort domein voor actieve recreatie. Zijn uniek en baanbrekend natuurgebonden concept biedt verschillende activiteiten voor alle leeftijden aan met 5 verschillende thema\u2019s: natuur, sport, cultuur, educatie en ontspanning. DROHME sluit naadloos aan bij de doelstellingen van \u2018Brussel, duurzame stad\u2019 en zal er \u00e9\u00e9n van de belangrijkste spelers van zijn.\r\n\r\nDe hippodroom was lange tijd een epicentrum voor sport en ontmoetingen, een plek waar Brusselaars kwamen ontspannen of aan paardenactiviteiten deelnemen. Vanaf 1995 begon echter het verval, toen de site zo goed als verlaten werd en zo stilaan zijn prestige en al zijn oorspronkelijke functies verloor.\r\n\r\nHet project DROHME Park wil de hippodroom in zijn vroegere glorie herstellen: als toegangspoort tot het Zoni\u00ebnwoud, als sport- en ontspanningsruimte voor het grote publiek en als locatie voor ontdekking van milieu en erfgoed, zonder echter aan zijn bijzondere identiteit te raken.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":26533,"location":{"lat":50.79681453,"lon":4.39647355},"last_updated_at":"2024-08-07T16:20:31+02:00","published_at":"2016-10-05T09:59:55+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":false,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/294275b67863e072f88ef4a31c5e48f13c07ab5e.jpg","width":1131,"height":1600,"ratio":0.71,"oEmbed_height":1600,"oEmbed_width":1131,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"pt":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"en":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"it":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"cn":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"fr":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"sp":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"},"nl":{"title":"Cape Town Ship","copyright":"Nadine Deruyck"}}}],"dates":[{"day":"2024-08-29","doors":null,"start":"12:00:00","end":"18:00:00","end_night_life":null,"is_soldout":false,"is_canceled":false},{"day":"2024-08-30","doors":nul