l Jacques Brel","shortdescr":"In partnership with Les soir\u00e9es Cerises, the Jacques Brel youth hostel organizes concerts throughout the summer to bring locals and travelers together in our friendly bar, where a diverse range of artists come to share their music in a warm atmosphere.","longdescr":"Join us for unforgettable summer nights at our hostel's vibrant bar, where live music meets the warm and welcoming atmosphere of our travelling community. Our Summer Concerts series features a diverse lineup of local artists from Jazz, Blue and Pop Rock as well as acoustic covers.\n\nAs the sun sets, gather with fellow travelers and locals to enjoy refreshing drinks, delicious bites and the rhythm of the summer season at our cozy bar where you can make new friends and learn of different travelers' experience.","performers":"Sian Able (Artist); Blues Messenger (Artist); Laura & Killian (Artists); Mathieu Simar (Artist); Sania (Artist); Flo Rockers (Artist); Lucile Revel & Roman Raynaud (Artists); Auberge de jeunesse Jacques Brel (Host); Les soir\u00e9es cerise (Host)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"brussels.brel@lesaubergesdejeunesse.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012131"},"it":{"name":"Summer Concerts - Youth Hostel Jacques Brel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"brussels.brel@lesaubergesdejeunesse.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012131"},"cn":{"name":"Summer Concerts - Youth Hostel Jacques Brel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"brussels.brel@lesaubergesdejeunesse.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012131"},"fr":{"name":"Summer Concerts - Auberge de Jeunesse Jacques Brel","shortdescr":"L'auberge de jeunesse Jacques Brel organise en partenariat avec Les soir\u00e9es Cerises des concerts tout au long de l'\u00e9t\u00e9 pour r\u00e9unir locaux et voyageurs dans notre bar convivial o\u00f9 une s\u00e9rie d'artistes divers viennent partager leur musique dans une ambiance chaleureuse.","longdescr":"Rejoignez-nous pour des nuits d'\u00e9t\u00e9 inoubliables au bar anim\u00e9 de notre auberge, o\u00f9 la musique live rencontre l'atmosph\u00e8re chaleureuse et accueillante de notre communaut\u00e9 de voyageurs. Notre s\u00e9rie des concerts de l'\u00e9t\u00e9 propose une programmation vari\u00e9e d'artistes locaux du Jazz, au Blues \u00e0 la Pop Rock, ainsi que des covers acoustiques.\n\nAu coucher du soleil, retrouvez des voyageurs et des habitants de la r\u00e9gion pour savourer des boissons rafra\u00eechissantes, de d\u00e9licieuses bouch\u00e9es et le rythme de la saison estivale dans notre bar cozy, o\u00f9 vous pourrez vous faire de nouveaux amis et d\u00e9couvrir l'exp\u00e9rience de diff\u00e9rents voyageurs.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"brussels.brel@lesaubergesdejeunesse.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012131"},"sp":{"name":"Summer Concerts - Youth Hostel Jacques Brel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"brussels.brel@lesaubergesdejeunesse.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012131"},"nl":{"name":"Summer Concerts - Auberge de Jeunesse Jacques Brel","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"brussels.brel@lesaubergesdejeunesse.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012131"}},"place":{"id":213976,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Jugendherberge Jacques Brel","address_street_name":"r. de la Sablonni\u00e8re","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":"brussels.brel@laj.be","website":"http:\/\/www.laj.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"r. de la Sablonni\u00e8re, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Jugendherberge Jacques Brel erwartet ihre G\u00e4ste mit einer jungen, internationalen Atmosph\u00e4re in Br\u00fcssel und \u00fcberzeugt als hochwertige Unterkunft f\u00fcr den schmalen Geldbeutel, perfekt f\u00fcr einen Kurztrip in die europ\u00e4ische Hauptstadt.\r\n\r\nSehensw\u00fcrdigkeiten, vielf\u00e4ltige Architektur, Nachtleben und der typische Br\u00fcsseler Charme machen Br\u00fcssel zu einem attraktiven Reiseziel. Dabei spielt die Jugendherberge Jacques Brel selbst eine aktive Rolle in der Br\u00fcsseler Kulturlandschaft, so werden hier in den Sommermonaten Konzerte ausgerichtet, hinzu kommen Themenabende, Ausstellungen und andere Unterhaltungsangebote.\r\n\r\nNicht zu vergessen auch die Bar mit gro\u00dfer Auswahl an belgischem Bier, die perfekte Erfrischung nach einem ausgedehnten Streifzug durch die Stadt!","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Auberge de Jeunesse Jacques Brel","address_street_name":"Rue de la Sablonni\u00e8re","address_street_number":"30","address_street_box":null,"email":"brussels.brel@laj.be","website":"http:\/\/www.laj.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 218 01 87","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la Sablonni\u00e8re, 30","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Auberge de Jeunesse Jacques Brel","