s g\u00e9n\u00e9rations qui ont toutes un point commun avec le fantastique, l\u2019\u00e9trange ou le surr\u00e9alisme. Sa collection m\u00e9lange de nombreuses techniques et invite \u00e0 l\u2019imaginaire et au voyage. C\u2019est \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re d\u2019un cabinet de curiosit\u00e9s que le mus\u00e9e propose aux visiteurs une balade fantasque et unique. Pass\u00e9s \u00e0 la moulinette du troisi\u00e8me mill\u00e9naire, Bosch, Breughel, Delvaux, Magritte, Herg\u00e9 ou Rops ne renieraient sans doute pas cet endroit fantasmagorique en plein coeur de Bruxelles !","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"MAF - Museo de Arte Fant\u00e1stico","address_street_name":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Am\u00e9ricaine, 7","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La colecci\u00f3n permanente del Museo de Arte Fant\u00e1stico posee art\u00edculos de diferentes \u00e9pocas: todos tienen algo en com\u00fan con la fantas\u00eda, lo extra\u00f1o y lo surrealista. Esta colecci\u00f3n completamente at\u00edpica mezcla todas las t\u00e9cnicas: artes visuales, pintura y escultura.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Museum voor Fantastische Kunst","address_street_name":"Amerikastraat","address_street_number":"7","address_street_box":null,"email":"infomafcaf@gmail.com","website":"http:\/\/www.fantastic-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 475 41 29 18","phone_booking":"+32 475 41 29 18","address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Amerikastraat, 7","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"Brussel is fantastisch! In een herenhuis 