rkshops to help you understand and enter the world of WEB3, organized by Artecom.io\n\nAt last, one-hour guided tours to discover this new world for groups of friends, colleagues or family including a group photo !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smurfs-society.bruxsls.art\/event","email":"info@artecom.eu","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011326"},"it":{"name":"AR(t) NFT Smurfs' Society Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smurfs-society.bruxsls.art\/fr\/event","email":"info@artecom.eu","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011326"},"cn":{"name":"AR(t) NFT Smurfs' Society Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smurfs-society.bruxsls.art\/fr\/event","email":"info@artecom.eu","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011326"},"fr":{"name":"AR(t) NFT Smurfs' Society Exposition","shortdescr":"L'\u00e9v\u00e9nement de l'\u00e9t\u00e9 2024: en l'honneur de la diversit\u00e9 et de l'inclusivit\u00e9\nUne exposition alliant l'art dans ses formes digitales et physiques : \"Phygital art\"\nUne exposition unique de 100 schtroumpfs issus de la collection priv\u00e9e de la Smurfs' Society AR(t)-NFT.\nChaque schtroumpf est unique et authentifi\u00e9 par un certificat NFT.\nUne vente priv\u00e9e d'AR(t)-NFT \u00e0 Tour&Taxis Gare Maritime.","longdescr":"Exposition des 100 schtroumpfs uniques de la collection priv\u00e9e Smurf's Society DAO\n\nVente priv\u00e9e des schtroumpfs authentiques sur le march\u00e9 secondaire phygital\n\nUn concours de selfie schtroumpf ouvert \u00e0 tous du 10.07 au 08.09.24 et \u00e0 la cl\u00e9 : des cadeaux offerts par nos sponsors : BD, Figurines, Food Market\n\nUne chasse au tr\u00e9sor de POAPS, trouvez les et gagnez la carte du collectionneur ART-NFT.Gallery !\n\nDes ateliers p\u00e9dagogiques pour comprendre et entrer dans le monde du WEB 3, organis\u00e9s par Artecom.ioArtecom.io\n\nEnfin des visites guid\u00e9es d'une heure pour d\u00e9couvrir ce nouveau monde pour des groupes d'amis, de coll\u00e8gues ou de famille avec une photo de groupe !","performers":"AR(t) NFT Gallery","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smurfs-society.bruxsls.art\/fr\/event","email":"info@artecom.eu","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011326"},"sp":{"name":"AR(t) NFT Smurfs' Society Exhibition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smurfs-society.bruxsls.art\/fr\/event","email":"info@artecom.eu","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011326"},"nl":{"name":"AR(t) NFT Smurfs' Society Tentoonstelling","shortdescr":"Het Summer 2024 Festival ter ere van diversiteit en inclusiviteit\nTentoonstelling van een priv\u00e9collectie die kunst in digitale en fysieke vorm combineert: \u201cPhygital art\u201d.\nUnieke tentoonstelling: 100 Smurfen uit de priv\u00e9collectie van de Smurfensoci\u00ebteit AR(t)-NFT\nElk Smurf Society-beeldprofiel is uniek en geauthenticeerd door een NFT-certificaat\nAR(t)-NFT priv\u00e9verkoop op de secundaire markt bij T&T","longdescr":"Tentoonstelling van 100 unieke Smurfen uit de priv\u00e9collectie van de Smurf's Society DAO Priv\u00e9verkoop\nvan authentieke Smurfen op een virtuele secundaire markt\n\nEen Smurfige Selfie Wedstrijd open voor iedereen van 10.07 tot 08.09.24 met prijzen geschonken door onze sponsors: Strips, Beeldjes, Voedingsmarkt\n\nEen POAP schattenjacht, vind ze en probeer de ART-NFT.Gallery verzamelkaart te winnen!\n\nEducatieve workshops om je te helpen de wereld van WEB3 te begrijpen en te betreden, georganiseerd door Artecom.io\n\nTot slot, rondleidingen van een uur om deze nieuwe wereld te ontdekken voor groepen vrienden, collega's of familie, inclusief een groepsfoto!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/smurfs-society.bruxsls.art\/nl\/event","email":"info@artecom.eu","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50011326"}},"place":{"id":280672,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Art.NFT.Gallery","address_street_name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis Rue Picard","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":"MODULE 8.3","email":"info@artecom.eu","website":"https:\/\/bxl.art-nft.gallery\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":"+32 474 30 33 80","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis Rue Picard, 9 \/ MODULE 8.3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Art.NFT.Gallery","address_street_name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis Rue Picard","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":"MODULE 8.3","email":"info@artecom.eu","website":"https:\/\/bxl.art-nft.gallery\/fr","phone_contact":"+32 478 29 20 43","phone_booking":"+32 474 30 33 80","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis Rue Picard, 9 \/ MODULE 8.3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Brussels ART NFT GALLERY","address_street_name":"Gare Maritime - Tour & Taxis Picardstratt","address_street_number":"9","address_street_box":"MODULE 8.3","email":"info@artecom.eu","website":"https:\/\/bxl.art-nft.gallery\/en","phone_contact"