uages":{"spoken":["es","nl","fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"de":"Ausstellung","pt":null,"en":"Exhibitions","it":"Esposizioni","cn":null,"fr":"Expositions","sp":"Exhibici\u00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[28,24],"translations":{"de":["Grafische K\u00fcnste","Kunstgalerien"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Graphic art","Art Galleries"],"it":["Arti grafiche","Gallerie d'arte"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Arts graphiques","Galeries d'art"],"sp":["Artes gr\u00e1ficas","Galer\u00edas de arte"],"nl":["Grafische kunst, vormgeving","Galeries"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Opening illustration exhibition SeeSun Collective(NL) 'Toys Toys Toys'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.grafik.brussels","email":"hello@grafik.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012146"},"pt":{"name":"Opening illustration exhibition SeeSun Collective(NL) 'Toys Toys Toys'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.grafik.brussels","email":"hello@grafik.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50012146"},"en":{"name":"Opening illustration exhibition SeeSun Collective(NL) 'Toys Toys Toys'","shortdescr":"'Toys toys toys' - As a collective, one of things that brought them together is their love for toys. Even after childhood, they have all continued collecting toys and appreciating their design, using them as a significant source of inspiration in their work. For this exhibition, the members of the collective created new prints and paintings, as well as 3D objects. #illustration #toys","longdescr":"We are very excited to announce upcoming group exhibition with SeeSunCollective from Rotterdam (NL):\nJoin in friday 12 july for the opening of TOYSTOYSTOYS! \n- Lots of fresh prints, a free welcome drink and DJ!\n- Meet and greet with Rotterdam artists of See&Sun \n- Live electronic music by one of the members of the collective!\nExhibition : 13.07.2024 - 12.09.2024\nVernissage : 12.07.2024 > 17:00-21:00 + live music by K9K\nSee and Sun Collective are 6 illustrator friends and collective based in Rotterdam (NL). They share their love for illustration, risography and murals. They also have a strong connection with South-Korea and its visual culture.\nAs a collective, one of things that brought them together is their love for toys. Even after childhood, they have all continued collecting toys and appreciating their design, using them as a significant source of inspiration in their work.\n\u201cWhat if we brought back our inner child-like playfulness?\u201d For this exhibition, the members of See collective each explore this question, creating prints and paintings, as well as 3D objects, as a result.\nIllustrators\nSona Lee \uc3d8\ub0d0\ub9ac\nLevi Jacobs \ub808\ube44\uc57c\ucf65\uc2a4 \nDraw Soso \ub4dc\ub85c\uc6b0\uc18c\uc18c \nK9k \uce74\ub124\ud754\uce74\nKidkura \ud0a4\ub4dc\ucfe0\ub77c\nLize Prins \ub9ac\uc81c\ud504\ub9b0\uc2a4\nSupported by\nDutch Embassy in Belgium\nGrafik.brussels\nAvenue Louis Bertrandlaan 30\n1030 Brussels\nwww.grafik.brussels\nhello@grafik.brussels","performers":"See and Sun Collective are 6 illustrator friends and collective based in Rotterdam (NL). They share their love for illustration, risography and murals. They also have a strong connection with South-Korea and its visual culture.\n\nIllustrators\nSona Lee \uc3d8\ub0d0\ub9ac\nLevi Jacobs \ub808\ube44\uc57c\ucf65\uc2a4 \nDraw Soso \ub4dc\ub85c\uc6b0\uc18c\uc18c \nK9k \uce74\ub124\ud754\uce74\nKidkura \ud0a4\ub4dc\ucfe0\ub77c\nLize Prins \ub9ac\uc81c\ud504\ub9b0\uc2a4","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.grafik.brussels","email":"hello@grafik.brussels","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visi