"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"},"en":{"name":"Opulent Origins pop-up","shortdescr":"Discover sustainable luxury and craftsmanship from a curated selection of designers and artisans. Don\u2019t miss this opportunity to create a unique style that reflects your personality.","longdescr":"We are excited to invite you to the Opulent Origins Pop-Up, taking place from 29th to 31st August in the vibrant Dansaert district of Brussels. This exclusive event, organised by An Vandenberk, aims to bring together a curated selection of sustainable designers and artisans, all connected by shared values of craftsmanship, sustainability, and individuality.\n\nAt the core of the pop-up are the avant-garde bamboo fashion line 'Just Be You in Bamboo' by This Is No Disco and An Vandenberk's unique leather goods. These collections are complemented by carefully selected designers who embody the ethos of slow fashion and eco-conscious living. Discover the minimalist and airy fashion by Val\u00e9rie Berckmans, the artisanal jewellery by Benaazir Mukherjee, the vibrant hand-painted scarves by Move Scarves, the colourful handmade glass couture jewellery by Bijoux Ortiz, the sustainable kimonos and sneakers by King Comf, and the upcycled vintage furniture by Reversa.\n\nTo celebrate the opening of the pop-up join us for a special evening drink on Thursday, 29th August from 6:00 PM, with the opportunity for a \"mise en beaut\u00e9\" by Julie from D\u00e9j\u00e0 Belle.\n\nThe goal of Opulent Origins is to showcase how sustainable fashion and design can be luxurious, timeless, and accessible. It\u2019s about celebrating the artistry and stories behind each piece while offering visitors the chance to create a unique and personal style.\n\nJoin us at Van Arteveldestraat 8 and immerse yourself in a world where sustainability meets elegance. We look forward to welcoming you to this unique shopping experience.\n\nEvent Details:\n\u2022 Dates: 29th - 31st August\n\u2022 Location: Val\u00e9rie Berckmans Boutique-Atelier, Van Arteveldestraat 8, 1000 Brussels\n\u2022 Time: 11:00 AM - 6:30 PM\n\nDon\u2019t miss this chance to meet the designers, explore their collections, and be part of a movement towards conscious and creative living. ","performers":"An Vandenberk \/ This Is No Disco : bamboo clothing and leathergoods\nVal\u00e9rie Berckmans : sustainable clothing\nBenaazir Mukherjee : artisanal silver jewellery\nRachel Ortiz \/ Bijoux Ortiz : glass jewellery\nMonique Verreydt \/ MoVe Scarves : silk scarves\nCleome Clements \/ King Comf : shoes and kimonos\nKatlijn Vernimmen \/ Reversa : upcycled vintage furniture\nJulie Berghmans \/ D\u00e9j\u00e0 Belle: Mise en beaut\u00e9","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anvandenberk.be","email":"an@anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"},"it":{"name":"Opulent Origins pop-up","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anvandenberk.be","email":"an@anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"},"cn":{"name":"Opulent Origins pop-up","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anvandenberk.be","email":"an@anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"},"fr":{"name":"Opulent Origins pop-up","shortdescr":"D\u00e9couvrez le luxe durable et l'artisanat \u00e0 travers une s\u00e9lection soign\u00e9e de designers et d'artisans. Ne manquez pas cette opportunit\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er un style unique qui refl\u00e8te votre personnalit\u00e9.","longdescr":"Nous sommes enchant\u00e9s de vous convier \u00e0 l'Opulent Origins Pop-Up, qui se d\u00e9roulera du 29 au 31 ao\u00fbt dans le dynamique quartier Dansaert de Bruxelles. Cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement exclusif, organis\u00e9e par An Vandenberk, rassemble une s\u00e9lection m\u00e9ticuleuse de cr\u00e9ateurs et d'artisans plus durables, tous unis par des principes communs d'artisanat, de durabilit\u00e9 et d'unicit\u00e9.\n\nAu c\u0153ur de cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement \u00e9ph\u00e9m\u00e8re, vous aurez l'opportunit\u00e9 de d\u00e9couvrir la collection avant-gardiste en bambou 'Just Be You in Bamboo' de This Is No Disco ainsi que la marroquinerie d'An Vandenberk. Ces s\u00e9lections sont compl\u00e9t\u00e9es par des cr\u00e9ateurs minutieusement choisis qui incarnent l'esprit de la slow fashion et du mode de vie \u00e9co-responsable. Explorez la mode minimaliste et a\u00e9rienne propos\u00e9e par Val\u00e9rie Berckmans, les bijoux artisanaux sign\u00e9s Benaazir Mukherjee, les \u00e9charpes en soie vivantes peintes \u00e0 la main chez Move Scarves, les bijoux en verre couture color\u00e9s faits main par Bijoux Ortiz, les kimonos et sneakers durables con\u00e7us par King Comf ainsi que les meubles vintage upcycl\u00e9s propos\u00e9s par Reversa.\n\nPour c\u00e9l\u00e9brer l'inauguration de ce pop-up, nous vous convions \u00e0 un verre convivial le jeudi 29 ao\u00fbt \u00e0 partir de 18h00 avec la possibilit\u00e9 de b\u00e9n\u00e9ficier d'une \u201cmise en beaut\u00e9\u201d par Julie de D\u00e9j\u00e0 Belle.\n\nL'objectif\nL'objectif d'Opulent Origins est de d\u00e9montrer comment la mode et le design durables peuvent \u00eatre \u00e0 la fois luxueux, intemporels et abordables. Il s'agit de mettre en valeur l'artisanat et les histoires derri\u00e8re chaque pi\u00e8ce, tout en offrant aux visiteurs la possibilit\u00e9 de cr\u00e9er un style unique et personnel.\n\nRejoignez-nous au 8 Van Arteveldestraat et plongez dans un univers o\u00f9 durabilit\u00e9 rime avec \u00e9l\u00e9gance. Nous avons h\u00e2te de vous accueillir pour cette exp\u00e9rience shopping sans pareille.\n\nInformations sur l'\u00e9v\u00e9nement :\n\nDates : 29 - 31 ao\u00fbt\nLieu : Boutique-Atelier Val\u00e9rie Berckmans, 8 Van Arteveldestraat, 1000 Bruxelles\nHoraires : 11h00 - 18h30\nNe manquez pas cette occasion de rencontrer les cr\u00e9ateurs, d'explorer leurs collections et de rejoindre un mouvement vers une vie consciente et cr\u00e9ative","performers":"An Vandenberk|This Is No Disco : bambou fashion et articles cuir\nVal\u00e9rie Berckmans : v\u00eatements durables\nBenaazir Mukherjee : bijoux artisanaux en argent\nRachel Ortiz \/ Bijoux Ortiz : bijoux en verre\nMonique Verreydt \/ MoVe Scarves : foulards en soie\nCleome Clements \/ King Comf : chaussures et kimonos\nKatlijn Vernimmen \/ Reversa : meubles vintage upcycl\u00e9s\nJulie Berghmans \/D\u00e9j\u00e0 Belle: Mise en beaut\u00e9","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anvandenberk.be","email":"an@anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"},"sp":{"name":"Opulent Origins pop-up","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anvandenberk.be","email":"an@anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"},"nl":{"name":"Opulent Origins pop-up","shortdescr":"Ervaar de weelde van duurzaamheid en vakmanschap in een zorgvuldig samengestelde collectie van ontwerpers en ambachtslieden. Laat deze gelegenheid niet aan je voorbijgaan om een unieke stijl die jouw persoonlijkheid weergeeft tot leven te laten komen.","longdescr":"Je bent van harte welkom op de Opulent Origins Pop-Up, die van 29 tot en met 31 augustus gehouden wordt in de bruisende Dansaertwijk in Brussel. Dit exclusieve evenement, georganiseerd door An Vandenberk, brengt een zorgvuldig geselecteerde groep duurzamere ontwerpers en ambachtslieden samen die dezelfde waarden delen op het gebied van vakmanschap, duurzaamheid en individualiteit.\n\nHet hoogtepunt van de pop-up zijn onder andere de avant-gardistische bamboe-modecollectie 'Just Be You in Bamboo' van This Is No Disco en de unieke lederwaren van An Vandenberk. Deze collecties worden aangevuld met zorgvuldig gekozen ontwerpers die slow fashion en milieubewust leven omarmen. Ontdek de minimalistische en luchtige mode van Val\u00e9rie Berckmans, het ambachtelijke sieradenwerk van Benaazir Mukherjee, de levendige handgeschilderde sjaals van Move Scarves, de kleurrijke handgemaakte glazen couture sieraden van Bijoux Ortiz, de duurzame kimono's en sneakers van King Comf, en het upcycled vintage meubilair van Reversa.\n\nOm de opening te vieren nodigen we je graag uit voor een speciale avondborrel op donderdag 29 augustus om 18:00 uur, met zelfs de mogelijkheid voor een \u201cmise en beaut\u00e9\u201d verzorgd door Julie van D\u00e9j\u00e0 Belle.\nOpulent Origins streeft ernaar om aan te tonen dat duurzame mode en design zowel luxe, tijdloos als toegankelijk kunnen zijn. Het draait allemaal om het vieren van de kunst en verhalen die schuilgaan achter elk kledingstuk, terwijl bezoekers de mogelijkheid hebben om een unieke en persoonlijke stijl te ontwikkelen.\n\nBreng ons een bezoek in de Van Arteveldestraat 8 en dompel je onder in een wereld waar duurzaamheid en elegantie harmonieus samenkomen. We kijken ernaar uit je te verwelkomen in deze bijzondere winkelervaring.\n\nDetails van het evenement:\n\nDatum: 29 - 31 augustus\nLocatie: Val\u00e9rie Berckmans Boutique-Atelier, Van Arteveldestraat 8, 1000 Brussel\nTijd: 11:00 -18:30 uur\n\nMis deze kans niet om de ontwerpers te ontmoeten, hun collecties te ontdekken en deel uit te maken van een beweging naar bewust en creatief leven.","performers":"An Vandenberk|This Is No Disco: bamboe kledij en upcycled lederwaren\nVal\u00e9rie Berckmans: duurzame kledij\nBenaazir Mukherjee: ambachtelijke zilveren juwelen \nRachel Ortiz \/ Bijoux Ortiz: glazen sieraden\nMonique Verreydt \/ MoVe Scarves: zijden sjaals\nCleome Clements \/ King Comf: schoenen en kimono\u2019s\nKatlijn Vernimmen \/ Reversa: ge\u00fcpcyclede vintage meubels\nJulie Berghmans \/ D\u00e9j\u00e0 Belle: Mise en beaut\u00e9","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.anvandenberk.be","email":"an@anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 465 90 44 37","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50013287"}},"place":{"id":265742,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde ","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde , 8","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"In her delightful little boutique-workshop, Val\u00e9rie Berckmans designs a women's ready-to-wear line in a sober, graphical style, enlivened here and there by special details, such as topstitching, hand embroidery and trompe-l'oeil elements. Her philosophy revolves around the criteria of sustainable development: ecological or fair-trade fabrics and recycled raw materials. All 100% trendy, colourful and Made in Belgium.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Dans sa ravissante petite boutique-atelier, Val\u00e9rie Berckmans con\u00e7oit une ligne de pr\u00eat-\u00e0-porter f\u00e9minin dans un style sobre et graphique, \u00e9gay\u00e9 \u00e7\u00e0 et l\u00e0 de d\u00e9tails particuliers, comme des surpiq\u00fbres, broderies \u00e0 la main, impressions et \u00e9l\u00e9ments en trompe-l\u2019\u0153il. Sa philosophie adh\u00e8re un maximum aux crit\u00e8res du d\u00e9veloppement durable: tissus bio ou issus du commerce \u00e9quitable, aux mati\u00e8res premi\u00e8res de r\u00e9cup\u00e9ration. Le tout 100% branch\u00e9, color\u00e9, et Made in Belgium.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Rue Van Artevelde","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Van Artevelde, 8","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Val\u00e9rie Berckmans","address_street_name":"Arteveldestraat","address_street_number":"8","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@valerieberckmans.be","website":"http:\/\/www.valerieberckmans.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 94 00","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Arteveldestraat, 8","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"In haar bekoorlijk klein boetiek-atelier ontwerpt Val\u00e9rie Berckmans een lijn met confectiekleding voor dames in een sobere, grafische stijl, hier en daar opgeleukt met een apart detail, zoals sierstiksels, handborduursels, prints en trompe-l'oeil-effecten. Haar filosofie sluit mooi aan bij de principes van duurzame ontwikkeling: ze werkt met biologische stoffen, stoffen uit de fairtrade-handel en grondstoffen uit gerecycleerde materialen. Dat alles 100 % trendy, kleurrijk \u00e9n Made in Belgium.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[3],"translations":{"de":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"pt":[null],"en":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"it":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"sp":["Dansaert\/Sainte-Catherine"],"nl":["Dansaertwijk\/Sint-Katelijne"]}},"zones":{"list":[19],"translations":{"de":["Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Centre"],"it":["Centro"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Centre"],"sp":["Centro"],"nl":["Centrum"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":25742,"location":{"lat":50.84852328,"lon":4.34749645},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T10:25:09+02:00","published_at":"2016-04-13T14:41:50+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":false,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":50002143,"translations":{"de":{"name":"An Vandenberk","address_street_name":"Van Ooststraat 56","address_street_number":"56","address_street_box":null,"email":"an@anvandenberk.be","website":"www.anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 468 14 15 87","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Van Ooststraat 56, 56","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"An Vandenberk","address_street_name":"Van Ooststraat 56","address_street_number":"56","address_street_box":null,"email":"an@anvandenberk.be","website":"www.anvandenberk.be","phone_contact":"+32 468 14 15 87","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1030","address_city":"Schaerbeek","address_line1":"Van Ooststraat 56, 56","address_line2":"1030 Schaerbeek","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"An Va