nfo@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010585"},"it":{"name":"PARLONS CASH | Literary tour by Amusea","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010585"},"cn":{"name":"PARLONS CASH | Literary tour by Amusea","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010585"},"fr":{"name":"PARLONS CASH | Balade litt\u00e9raire par Amusea","shortdescr":"Dans le cadre de l\u2019exposition CA$H, Jeanne Delsarte vous fera d\u00e9couvrir des autrices et auteurs d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui et d\u2019hier qui abordent la question de l\u2019argent, qui nous inclut ou nous marginalise.","longdescr":"Dans le cadre de l\u2019exposition CA$H, Jeanne Delsarte vous fera d\u00e9couvrir des autrices et auteurs d\u2019aujourd\u2019hui et d\u2019hier qui abordent la question de l\u2019argent, qui nous inclut ou nous marginalise.\n\nUne balade organis\u00e9e par Amusea , dans le cadre de leur projet \u00ab Jamais deux sans trois \u00bb, qui reprend \u00e9galement des balades litt\u00e9raires \u00e0 La Maison d\u2019\u00c9rasme et \u00e0 la Wittockiana.\n\nR\u00e9servez ici : https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-5f6a | 8\u20ac par personne.\n\n(Vous \u00eates en possession d\u2019un Pass Cultuur Marolles ? Vous profitez de 2\u20ac de r\u00e9duction. Dans ce cas \u2013 uniquement \u2013 r\u00e9servez par mail \u00e0 sarah.kokot@artetmarges.be et pr\u00e9cisez dans votre message que vous \u00eates en possession du pass)","performers":"Jeanne Delsarte (com\u00e9dienne)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010585"},"sp":{"name":"PARLONS CASH | Literary tour by Amusea","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010585"},"nl":{"name":"PARLONS CASH | Literaire wandeling door Amusea","shortdescr":"In het kader van de tentoonstelling CA$H laat Jeanne Delsarte je kennismaken met auteurs uit heden en verleden die zich buigen over geld, of het ons insluit of marginaliseert.\n\n","longdescr":"In het kader van de tentoonstelling CA$H laat Jeanne Delsarte je kennismaken met auteurs uit heden en verleden die zich buigen over geld, of het ons insluit of marginaliseert.\n\nDeze wandeling wordt georganiseerd door Amusea in het kader van hun project 'Jamais deux sans trois', dat ook literaire wandelingen in La Maison d'\u00c9rasme en La Wittockiana omvat.\n\nIn het frans | Boek hier: https:\/\/miniurl.be\/r-5f6a | \u20ac8 per persoon.\n\n(Heb je een Pass Cultuur Marolles? Dan krijg je \u20ac2 korting. Reserveer in dit geval - alleen - per e-mail op sarah.kokot@artetmarges.be en vermeld in je bericht dat je in het bezit bent van de pas)","performers":"Jeanne Delsarte (actrice)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","email":"info@artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50010585"}},"place":{"id":738,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Art brut - Outsider Art - Zeitgen\u00f6ssische Kunst\r\n\r\nDas Museum Art et Marges zeigt eine Sammlung, die seit den 1980er-Jahren kontinuierlich w\u00e4chst. Dabei handelt es sich um Kunst abseits des Mainstreams, die einen Blick auf die autodidaktischen K\u00fcnslter wirft, Kunstateliers f\u00fcr Menschen mit geistiger Behinderung oder in Psychiatrien. \r\nIn den Ausstellungen mischen sich K\u00fcnstler diesseits und jenseits der Grenze des \"Au\u00dfenseitertums\" (engl. Begriff \"Art Outsider\"), die die Kunst und deren Beschr\u00e4nkungen hinterfragt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Hoogstraat","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Hoogstraat, 314","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Located in the heart of Brussels, the Art et marges museum is dedicated to \u2018art brut\u2019 or \u2018outsider art\u2019.\nIts collection was built up from the mid-1980s with artworks from self-taught artists and artistic workshops for the mentally disabled and the psychologically fragile. It now comprises over 4,500 international works produced outside the established contemporary art circuit.\n\nIts temporary exhibitions bring together artists from both sides of the fringe, questioning the boundaries of art and its very definition.\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Art et marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e est consacr\u00e9 \u00e0 l\u2019Art brut ou outsider.\nSa collection s\u2019est constitu\u00e9e d\u00e8s le milieu des ann\u00e9es 80 aupr\u00e8s d\u2019artistes auto